    {
      "content": "Let me explain how our pricing works, then it is super simple. We charge an early rate of 105 dollars per hour PerMe and we provide 26 foot box truck with everything needed. Everything is already included on the R. D. Weigh. That is the gas, the trucks, taxes and insurance all the wraps, the pods, the bunds to protect your item and being moved and all of the tools for disassemble and reassembly furniture and appliances and in addition to that simple and easy to understand pricing, we also have some extra perks that our customer really appreciate first is that we have no worry damage coverage included on the R-D weight that you're paying us, we will provide up to 2000 dollars remove that is to repair, replace and members for your items.",
