    },
    {
      "content": "Second is that we have meter mover feature so few days before your move. We will be sending out emails letting you know who will be your movers are in that way it will help east attention of strangers arriving at the front door. Finally we have on time guarantee we value your time. So, if you cannot make it to the time window that we arrange, we immediately start discounting money of your final bill. The best part is that there's no hidden fees of any type. No credit card fees, no sterle fees, no disassemble or V. assembly fees. Again no hedden fees of any type and the, how the clock works is that the time will only start as soon as we get on site and open the contract for you will then have us for as long as you need this and for any move. We have a minimum of two and a half hours once to go over that it will always be prorated in fifteen minute increments. Does that make sense?",
